---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CONTACT } from "../lib/brand";
const pilot="https://wa.me/"+CONTACT.whatsapp+"?text="+encodeURIComponent("Hello HashBrown Studios. I'd like to understand the shared platform and early-access programme.");
const layers=[["01","Customer website","A branded public experience for discovering vehicles or services, submitting enquiries, requesting quotes and making eligible bookings."],["02","Business dashboard","A private workspace for managing customers, inventory, scheduling, quotes, jobs, staff, payment records and reports."],["03","Platform administration","HashBrown's internal tools for provisioning businesses, configuring template entitlements, monitoring usage and supporting tenants."]];
const shared=["Tenant branding and custom-domain configuration","Customer profiles and enquiry pipeline","Quotes, tasks and operational activity history","Scheduling and resource availability","Media library and controlled file access","Notifications, integrations and reporting"];
---
<Base title="The HashBrown Platform — Shared Automotive Software" description="An overview of the shared platform architecture behind HashBrown's four automotive software templates." path="/platform/">
<div class="hb-site"><header class="hb-header"><div class="hb-header-inner"><a class="hb-wordmark" href="/"><span class="hb-mark">hb</span><span>HashBrown<small>STUDIOS</small></span></a><nav class="hb-nav"><a href="/#templates">Solutions</a><a href="/platform/">Platform</a><a href="/#work">Selected work</a><a href="/#about">About</a></nav><a class="hb-button hb-button-dark hb-header-cta" href={pilot}>Discuss early access ↗</a><details class="hb-mobile-nav"><summary aria-label="Open navigation"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav><a href="/#templates">Solutions</a><a href="/#work">Selected work</a><a href="/#contact">Contact</a></nav></details></div></header>
<main id="main"><section class="hb-shell hb-platform-hero"><a class="hb-back" href="/">← Home</a><p class="hb-eyebrow">THE SHARED PLATFORM</p><h1>One platform.<br/><span>Four specialist systems.</span></h1><p class="hb-platform-lede">The common foundation behind each HashBrown automotive template: tenant-branded customer websites, private business dashboards and a shared operational engine.</p><span class="hb-status">PLANNED ARCHITECTURE / EARLY ACCESS</span></section>
<section class="hb-section hb-section-light"><div class="hb-shell"><div class="hb-section-heading"><div><p class="hb-eyebrow">THREE CONNECTED LAYERS</p><h2>Built to work<br/><span>as one system.</span></h2></div><p>Each business has its own workspace and customer-facing brand. Shared platform services are maintained centrally; vertical workflows remain specific to the industry.</p></div><div class="hb-layer-list">{layers.map(l=><article><span>{l[0]}</span><div><h3>{l[1]}</h3><p>{l[2]}</p></div><b>↗</b></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="hb-section hb-section-paper"><div class="hb-shell hb-platform-shared"><div><p class="hb-eyebrow">SHARED CAPABILITIES</p><h2>Build the common parts once.</h2><p>Customer records, permissions, scheduling primitives and notification infrastructure should not be rebuilt separately for each template. The operational rules that make a rental different from a workshop job stay inside their own template modules.</p></div><ul>{shared.map(s=><li><span>+</span>{s}</li>)}</ul></div></section>
<section class="hb-section hb-section-dark"><div class="hb-shell hb-workflow-grid"><div><p class="hb-eyebrow">DELIVERY ORDER</p><h2>Four templates.<br/><span>Built in sequence.</span></h2></div><ol><li><span>01</span><b>Rent-a-Car</b></li><li><span>02</span><b>Used Car Showrooms</b></li><li><span>03</span><b>Mechanics & Workshops</b></li><li><span>04</span><b>Car Detailing Studios</b></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="hb-section hb-section-light"><div class="hb-shell hb-scope-note"><small>EARLY ACCESS</small><p>The architecture and product scope are still being defined.</p><a class="hb-button hb-button-dark" href={pilot}>Discuss a pilot ↗</a></div></section></main>
<footer class="hb-footer"><div class="hb-shell hb-footer-main"><a class="hb-wordmark" href="/"><span class="hb-mark">hb</span><span>HashBrown<small>STUDIOS</small></span></a><p>Automotive business software,<br/>designed in Islamabad.</p><nav><a href="/#templates">Solutions</a><a href="/platform/">Platform</a><a href="/#work">Selected work</a><a href="/#contact">Contact</a></nav><div><a href={"mailto:"+CONTACT.email}>{CONTACT.email}</a><a href={CONTACT.phoneHref}>{CONTACT.phoneDisplay}</a><span>{CONTACT.address}</span></div></div><div class="hb-shell hb-footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} HASHBROWN STUDIOS</span><span>FOUR AUTOMOTIVE TEMPLATES / ONE PLATFORM</span><a href="#main">BACK TO TOP ↑</a></div></footer></div>
</Base>